    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nO'Donnellan & Joyce Joyce Auctioneers are delighted to offer for sale this immaculate three-bedroom semi-detached residence on a large corner site. \n\nPositioned in the popular residential development on the top of Ballymoneen Road, no.11 Maoilin is offered in turn-key & modern condition which is highlighted in the A3 energy rating. \n\nComprising of approximately 112.9 sq.m over two storeys, the property offers spacious & well proportioned accommodation throughout. \n\nThe ground floor is arranged via a large welcoming hall with connections to the front living room, open-plan kitchen-dining area at the rear, separate utility & completed by the guest bathroom. \n\nUpstairs is arranged between three sizeable bedrooms, all suitable for double beds, and a main family bathroom. The main bedroom offers an impressive amount of space & avails of its own en-suite.\n\nA key feature of no.11 Maoilin is the outside space on offer. To the front is a cobbled patio driveway comfortably fitting two vehicles, whilst the rear of the house is particularly impressive. \n\nThe corner site position results in a substantial sized garden with manicured green, mature landscaped planting, & separate patio ideal for outdoor hosting. \n\nAdditionally, the rear garden comes with service connections already in place for a new owner wanting to construct a separate chalet in the future. \n\nMaoilin is a popular & modern residential development constructed circa 2016 by the renowned Burkeway Homes. The communal areas offer a large central green with landscaping & children's playground. \n\nSituated at the top of Ballymoneen Road, Maoilin is well positioned for local amenities & landmarks of Knocknacarra, as well as quality regular transport links giving easy access to all of Galway City.\n\nNo.11 Maoilin will be an ideal property for a variety of purchasers seeking turn-key condition, quality finishes and substantial living space, internally & externally. \n\nViewing is highly recommended. \n\nKeep up to-date with NEW PROPERTIES by registering your details on our database \n\nFor Further details please contact our office on 091-564212 \nOFFICE OPENING HOURS - MON TO FRI 9AM TO 5:30PM\n\nProperties can be viewed on our website www.odj.ie \n\nNOTE: These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer. They are for information only and give a general idea of the property. They are not to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract, nor to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact. Whilst every care is taken in their preparation, neither O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars. No person in the employment of O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
